# Visual review: borders, icons and badges

Keep container edges quiet, keep input boundaries strong and use rounded badges for counts. The review that led to these rules found poor icon hierarchy, harsh card outlines and dividers, and an angular notification count. A passing contrast test had not shown a coherent visual hierarchy.

This page is for maintainers changing the theme or the documentation styles. It compares the public GOV.UK homepage, official component sources and repository revision `95b7a58`. The findings table records source evidence. The Overview findings were also observed live in Chrome on Home Assistant 2026.11.0. The corrections are decisions.


